ng\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u6uA7Yo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wm2UCet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cw074li.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2j5X6pZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DXcKlJf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vTsTyrz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mQgIVDu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5xXqhXe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kVHzJV9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" /><br /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aHc4S93.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aK7ykEb.png\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pwwoJoz.png\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uvtNHb5.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VYJzkYE.png\" width=\"51\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Just Potion Rings 是一款受《Potion Fingers》啟發的模組，它會將所有生物效果轉化為戒指。</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">即使你安裝了新增更多效果的模組，Just Potion Rings 仍會為這些新效果自動新增對應的戒指。</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">請查看 Wiki 以獲取：</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">合成配方</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/LootChest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">戰利品箱</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Trades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">交易</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">指令</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki#compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">相容性</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Datapack#how-to-create-a-ring-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">如何透過 DataPack 製作戒指合成配方</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nNw9qcQ.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEo18QI.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>常見問題（F.A.Q.）</strong></span></em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我可以將 Just Potion Rings 加入我的整合包中嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：當然可以，只需在「相關專案」中列出我的模組即可。<br /><strong>問：在原版體驗中我能獲得多少枚戒指？</strong><br />答：原版體驗中僅可獲得 13 枚戒指。請查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wiki</a> 了解合成配方及其他獲得方式。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：為什麼 Just Potion Rings 沒有提供 Forge 1.21.x 版本？</strong><br />答：目前尚未有 Curios 的 1.21.x 版本，詳細原因請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/TheIllusiveC4/Curios/issues/427\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">此處</a>。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我該如何為其他藥水效果製作更多配方？它是否支援模組添加的效果？</strong><br />答：你可以透過 DataPack 製作配方，請參考 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wiki</a> 了解具體操作。是的，它完全支援由模組新增的藥水效果。</span></p>",
